flowchart TD
    %% Main Terms and Conditions Page
    A[Super Administrator Dashboard] --> B[Terms and Conditions Page]
    
    %% Main Navigation Elements
    B --> C[Clickable Table of Contents]
    B --> D[Expandable Sections]
    B --> E[Search Functionality]
    B --> F[Highlight Updates]
    B --> H[Printable Format]
    B --> I[Contact Us Button]

    %% Clickable Table of Contents
    C --> C1[Introduction]
